ng/AttachLive/9fed0a82-7f2a-4c0d-ab21-375c20921253.pdf","mcap":14.5,"doc":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/9fed0a82-7f2a-4c0d-ab21-375c20921253.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**Railtel Corporation Of India** — receives a **Rs 167.52 crore** Letter of Acceptance from Railway Recruitment Board Secunderabad for AM-RMS recruitment services, covering pre- and post-exam stages through October 2031 _(~2.1% of mcap, our arithmetic)_.","**GPT Infraprojects** — step-down subsidiary Alcon Builders wins a **Rs 134.11 crore** Western Railway signalling contract for the Ratlam division, converting its 1-Oct L1 status into an award _(~8.4% of mcap)_.","**Ameenji Rubber** — bags three same-day Rubber Pads Letters of Acceptance from Railway materials-management offices in Maharashtra (Rs 50.45 cr), Secunderabad (Rs 13.41 cr) and Hajipur (Rs 2.45 cr), totalling **Rs 66.31 crore** _(~23.3% of mcap)_.","**Chamunda Electrical** — receives a **Rs 1.69 crore** work order from Gujarat Energy Transmission Corporation to shift 220/66 kV control-room equipment at its Vapi substation, due in 8 months _(~3.4% of mcap; SME)_.","**Agarwal Toughened Glass** — receives a **Rs 4.24 crore** purchase order for DGU/SGU value-added toughened glass for a medical college project in Jaipur, to be executed by March 2027 _(~1.1% of mcap; SME)_.","**Shree Marutinandan Tubes** — receives a **Rs 0.30 crore** work order from GS PEB & Civil Works for pipe and sanitary fixtures at a Nagpur project site, valid to April 2027 _(~2.1% of mcap; SME)_.","**Positron Energy** — awarded a competitive-bid tender by a PSU for spot supply of ~50,000 MMBTU of RLNG through end-October, worth an estimated **Rs 12.5 crore** _(~7.5% of mcap)_."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Refex Renewables & Infrastructure** — board approves a **proposed preferential issue of up to 4,50,000 equity shares** to a non-promoter investor for up to **Rs 16.20 crore** at Rs 360 each, subject to shareholder approval _(~10.1% of mcap)_.","**Unifinz Capital India** — EGM notice (11-Nov) seeks approval for up to 98,01,000 convertible warrants to seven non-promoter allottees, aggregating up to **Rs 99.97 crore**, proposed and not yet approved."],"equity_allotments":["**Apollo Pipes** — allots 20,00,000 equity shares at Rs 550 each to non-promoter KITARA PIIN 2401, completing an April-2025 warrant issue, for **Rs 110.00 crore** _(~4.7% of mcap; past warrant conversion)_.","**Pakka** — allots 38,80,000 equity shares to promoter-group entity Yash Agro Products at Rs 110 each, completing conversion of June-2026 warrants, for **Rs 42.68 crore**; 38,20,000 warrants remain outstanding to December 2027 _(past warrant conversion)_.","**Krishival Foods** — converts 5,51,289 partly-paid rights shares into fully paid shares on receipt of a **Rs 10.75 crore** final call payment, part of its December-2025 rights issue _(~1.2% of mcap)_.","**Pritika Engineering Components** — allots 50,00,000 shares to promoter Pritika Auto Industries converting a **Rs 32.00 crore** unsecured loan into equity, plus a fresh **Rs 7.68 crore** preferential issue of 12,00,000 shares to the public category and 4,00,000 part-paid warrants (25% received, Rs 0.64 crore) to Healthy Biosciences, all at Rs 64/share _(~15.4% of mcap on the loan-conversion leg)_.","**Sambhv Steel Tubes** — allots 86,95,400 fresh convertible warrants at Rs 115 each to promoters and non-promoters, receiving the 25% subscription price of **Rs 24.9999 crore** now; conversion to equity follows within 18 months.","**Shri Ahimsa Naturals** — allots 7,10,400 equity shares at Rs 227 each to three public investors on conversion of warrants issued November 2025, for **Rs 16.13 crore** _(our arithmetic: 7,10,400 x Rs 227; past warrant conversion)_."],"m_and_a":["**Zen Technologies** — board approves acquiring a **51.98% stake in Cogknit Semantics Private Limited**, an AI-enabled battlefield-management and situational-awareness systems developer for the armed forces, for aggregate cash consideration not exceeding **Rs 135.15 crore**.","**JSW Steel** — NCLT Mumbai sanctions the Scheme of Amalgamation of Piombino Steel into JSW Steel, first intimated 30-Jul; the effective date follows a separate certified-order filing.","**KPI Green Energy** — material subsidiary Sun Drops Energia completes acquisition of a further 43,49,560 shares of DEK and Mavericks Green Energy, taking its stake to 88.37%; consideration already disclosed in the August/September intimations.","**Acutaas Chemicals** — completes an internal transfer of its step-down subsidiary Enchem Ami Organics from one wholly owned subsidiary to another, making it a direct wholly owned subsidiary; an intra-group reorganisation, no external consideration.","**Gujarat Industries Power** — Bondada Engineering Limited accepts the Letter of Intent for the 20 MW/120 MWh Battery Energy Storage System contract GIPCL awarded in August, finalising the earlier-disclosed award; no new figure."],"capex_core":["**TVS Srichakra** — approves **Rs 49.20 crore** of debottlenecking capex at its Madurai and Uttarakhand plants, adding 6-7% tyre capacity in phases from January 2027 _(~1.5% of mcap)_."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 28 companies filed results or earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Antony Waste Handling Cell** — Q2 FY27 total tonnage managed grew ~0.8% YoY to ~1.28 million tonnes despite the PCMC waste-to-energy facility's suspension; Collection & Transportation volumes rose ~11.5% YoY to ~0.60 million tonnes, while H1 FY27 total tonnage reached ~2.71 million tonnes, up ~4.5% YoY.","**GRE Renew Enertech** — fortnightly business update: three rooftop/ground-mounted solar EPC orders received 1-15 October, aggregating **Rs 18.67 crore**, routine in nature per the filing's own clarification."],"distress_risk":["**Kalpataru** — wholly owned subsidiary Kalpataru Properties receives a GST Show Cause-cum-Demand Notice for **Rs 73.85 crore** plus interest and penalty, covering FY26 construction services; the company says the notice is not sustainable and has no material financial impact.","**Zodiac Energy** — the Gujarat High Court quashes and sets aside a GST Show Cause Notice (June 2025) and the consequential DRC-07 demand order for FY19, ruling in the company's favour; demand amount not disclosed in the filing."],"other_notable":["**SIS** — closes its open-market buyback having deployed **Rs 105.99 crore**, 100% of the Rs 106 crore maximum size approved in August."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/RAILTEL_17102026133732_Railtel_Order_Book_Company_Rep_161026.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GPTINFRA_17102026103405_PressReleaseintimationContractwin13411Cr171026.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/10b353de-f7e3-494d-8e6d-c266d4fc71db.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/CHAMUNDA_17102026170639_Announcement.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/AGARWALTOUGHENED_17102026135335_TUFF_business_update_.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/9fed0a82-7f2a-4c0d-ab21-375c20921253.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POSITRON_17102026175328_General_Update_17102026.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null}],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":[